window.products.push({"id":716067,"name":"3 Piece Utensil Set (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aDUzYGgNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Versatile Set This affordable, multi-use three piece kitchen utensil set features three types of cooking utensils - a spoon, a turner and a fork. Each and every piece will make a wonderful addition to your home kitchen and will see plenty of use. It's a small but mighty set to help both seasoned chefs and new cooks reach their culinary heights. Won't Damage Non-Stick Pots and Pans This might be the best kitchen utensil set that you'll find yourself using over and over again to impress family and friends while you cook, serve and entertain like a pro. Made of strong and durable plastic, this full kitchen utensil set will easily withstand heavy, everyday use, but won't harm your non-stick cookware. Safe Kitchen Tool Set to Use at High Temperatures With your safety in mind, this kitchen tool set is completely BPA-free. In addition, all the utensils feature high-grade, heat-tolerant plastic construction that's heat-resistant up to 410 degrees Fahrenheit, so you can use high temperatures without worry. Hassle-Free Cleanups You'll definitely appreciate that this kitchen utensil set is so easy to clean. It's 100% dishwasher safe so you won’t have to spend any time hand-washing the items. Put everything right into the dishwasher, turn it on and enjoy your free time. Makes a Thoughtful Gift This utensil set is a must-have for any home. Add it to your collection of kitchen tools, or give it as a wonderful wedding present for a couple looking to build a new home together. It's also a great starter set for students leaving home for the first time. Equal Parts Form and Function Each piece in this cooking utensil set is 10 inches long, allowing you to easily flip, scoop and serve all types of foods of every size, great and small. Plus, with a pleasing, minimalist design and dramatic black coloring, this set will look great in any kitchen décor scheme.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aDUzYGgNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Akurn","source_asin":"B08C67T6PQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-716067","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C67T6PQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C67T6PQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
