window.products.push({"id":716115,"name":"Ever Variety Automatic Soap Dispenser – Touchless Soap Dispenser with Infrared Motion Sensor – No Touch Soap Dispenser with Waterproof","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BxojofEzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Maintaining your health and having an improved hygiene level is now more important than ever, leaving no room for compromise. That's why Ever Variety works only with top-quality materials and verified suppliers, which are guaranteed to deliver to our high expectations. If for some reason you're not entirely pleased with your purchase, our customer care department has got you covered! Why is this product for you? The Ever Variety automatic soap dispenser features the latest infrared activated technology, a sleek, cordless, elegant steel design, and premium features, being suitable for kitchens, bathrooms, public spaces, offices, hospitals, or restaurants. The 100% hands-free design means minimal contamination risk, improving hygiene levels for users. Some of the amazing features of this product: 4-level volume control, quiet operation 250ml refillable tank 3-5cm sensing distance Adjustable liquid dispensing; Powered by 4 x AAA Alkaline batteries (Not included)  Waterproof non-slip base Easy DIY installation What is in the Box? 1 x Ever Variety Automatic Soap Dispenser 1 x Battery Cover 1 x Waterproof Base 1 x Quick Guide Manual  Reap all the benefits this state of the art stainless steel auto soap dispenser has to offer! Warm tips Alkaline batteries are highly recommended for this dispenser Gel or thick liquid is not suitable for this dispenser. If you pour thick liquid, please add proper water to ensure normal output When used for the first time, trigger sensors 10 to 20 times until the soap begins to dispense Please keep the 2pcs smart infra-red motion sensors clear Please keep the bottom of the automatic soap dispenser dry, do not soak it in water to avoid damage to the unit Do not wash the touchless soap dispenser. Wipe clean with a damp cloth","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BxojofEzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ever Variety","source_asin":"B08DTKQV2K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-716115","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DTKQV2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DTKQV2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
