window.products.push({"id":716144,"name":"Kitchen mixing bowls 5 pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VESU3kKpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY STEEL AND DESIGN. Made of high quality metal our bowls will provide you long lasting service term. They are rust resistant and will never have odors or stains. Due to their size, our kitchen set is ideal for storing, pickling and slicing any food from fruits, vegetables, and cereals to meat and greens. They are can be both a great gift and a great addition to your kitchen. Daikoku metal bowls for cooking can help you to save a lot of energy and time during the food preparation. EASY TO USE AND STORE. Our metal mixing bowls with lids can be used in the refrigerator. They can be cleaned by hand with water and soap or in your dishwasher. Also, if you put our bowls together, they will not take much space on your kitchen shelf and you can always choose the container you need at the moment. Our food prep bowls have 5 different sizes for the maximum wideness of use. They are perfect for pouring, mixing, serving and meals preparing, they can be used as salad mixing bowls. HERMETIC VALVE. In order to store your products hermetically our kitchen bowls have a special valve that must be opened when the lid is closing. It helps to release excess air and make sure that your food is stored or marinated in an airtight place from where odors would not spread. Also this valve is an important competitive advantage, because our most steel bowls with lid competitors do not have this option what makes our metal mixing bowl set unique at the market. LID GRATERS. We believe that our customers don't need to buy separate containers for chopped food, as our set of bowls includes special graters that can be installed in the lid! You just need to choose the type of grater you need, put it in the lid of any of our metal bowl set and get the result you want! Our lid graters are made of high-quality stainless steel and will serve you for many years. They are perfect for fruits, vegetables, cheese and any other food. MAKE YOUR FAMILY HAPPY. Now you don't need to have a separate set of graters and mixing bowls where the sliced food would go. Our stainless mixing bowls combine 2 types of kitchen utensils at one which will make your life and the life of your family simpler, cleaner and more convenient. In addition, this set of bowls can be a great gift for those who are likes cooking. And we can definitely say that our bowls set will not leave this person indifferent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VESU3kKpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Daikoku","source_asin":"B08P1QQZXK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-716144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P1QQZXK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P1QQZXK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
