window.products.push({"id":716242,"name":"Aliyoham Electric Grill Indoor/Outdoor, 2 in 1 Non-stick& Smokeless BBQ with Thermostat, Portable Removable Stand Grill, Easy to Clean, Grill Size 15x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71paY73F3DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2 in 1 Electric Grill】Our Electric grill has adjustable thermostat& indicator light, non-stick and smokeless. 1700 Watts, 120 volts. Grill size 15x11 inch, 165 Square inches of Grilling Surface. 2 in 1 design, either put on the table, or stand in the living room, kitchen, and garden. Just 5 minutes setting up the legs for first time using. Fast& Evenly distributed heat 【FAST HEATING】Lower/Upper position of grill rack for cooking meat or vegetables. Bottom shelf for placing food and seasoning. Max Temperature could reach 360°F. KEEP food warm mode is turning the thermostat control knob to 6 o'clock(indicator light just right turn off), the heating element will be switched on and off alternatively. 36\" Power cord 【PREMIUM QUALITY】Outer shell - Black part on top is made of plastic. PLEASE ALWAYS ADD WATER on it for preventing overheating and easy clean after use. Putting it on the table won’t cause any damage, hands won’t get scalded touching the edge of grill. Non-stick & Anti-rust grill rack is easy to clean and reuse. Aluminum foil can be placed on the grill. Oil drip pan is made of zinc. Insert 4 legs into the holes at back of the grill, easily detachable for moving easily. It's not \"Unstable legs\" 【SAFE USE】 ETL listed. 12-month warranty. Micro-switch in heating element, put the heating element into the body perfectly to electrify. There’s a \"clank\" sound when micro-switch connected. Then turn on thermostat control, it's working when indicator is on. If the grill separate from the heating element accidentally, it would auto-stop for protection 【ENJOY YOUR BBQ】Electric grill perfectly replaces Charcoal grill, especially great for apartments and patios. It’s suitable for family gathering, Indoor BBQ party, caravan and self-catering holidays. Please read the instructions carefully. If you're lazy to add water, please find other products. Our electric grill has 1700W power heating elements, adding water on zinc plate is necessory. If you have any question, message us any time","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71paY73F3DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aliyoham","source_asin":"B09FSZ5GHB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-716242","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FSZ5GHB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FSZ5GHB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
