window.products.push({"id":716365,"name":"Lapert Pour Over Coffee Maker,Pour Over Coffee Dripper Includes V60 Filter,Coffee Pot(500ML) with Insulation Silicone Cover,Coffee Filters Paper(100pc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SwrXpD0JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【POUR OVER GLASS COFFEE MAKER】 - The Pour over coffee maker set gives you a traditional hands-on brewing experience.The Coffee pour over set with V60 filter(Coffee filter is supported by a Bamboo frame) and is uniquely designed to extend the mixing time of coffee and water for a stronger coffee.You can have a delicious cup or two of coffee anytime, anywhere,500ml Coffee pot is also perfect for sharing with friends. 【V60 DESIGN】 - The coffee filter has a V-shaped cone shape that allows the coffee grounds to build up higher for full extraction. The drip coffee maker has a spiral guide structure on the inner wall that allows the coffee grounds to stay in contact with the water stream longer, resulting in a more robust coffee flavor. The V-shaped spout design allows for a smoother flow of coffee when pouring. 【UNIQUE QUALITY】 -Coffee maker set and Coffee pot is made of high quality high borosilicate glass, high hardness, high transparency, not easy to break. Cold and high temperature resistant, can withstand -20℃ and 150℃ temperature difference. Refrigerator freezing and adding hot water will not blow up, can be directly heated on gas/electric stove (Note: please do not heat the empty pot). Easy to clean, dishwasher safe. 【EXQUISITE GIFTS FOR HER】 - This 3 in 1 pour over coffee maker includes coffee filter, Coffee cup with cover, Dripper Holder, V60 Filter Paper(100pcs) . The perfect starter setup for yourself, or a gift. Great for those new to pour over or manual coffee brewing. 【SERVICE GUARANTEE】 - Customer satisfaction is our top priority and our goal is to achieve 100% satisfaction for all our customers. Based on the quality of our products we offer a 1 year warranty to every customer who loves our pour over glass coffee maker, If you are not satisfied, please feel free to send us an email message and we will reply as soon as possible to solve your problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SwrXpD0JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lapert","source_asin":"B09XR7959Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-716365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XR7959Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XR7959Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
