window.products.push({"id":716636,"name":"Kitchen Lux 10oz Highball Tumblers - Set of 6 Drinking Glasses - Clear Glass with Gold Rim - Wine, Shots, Cocktails, Champagne, All-Purpose Cups, Eleg","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k+MHtR0UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Style up your home and kitchen with Kitchen Lux and our various collection of glasses, cups, and carafes that are designed to add a whole lot of class! Perfectly constructed with clear glass and a stylish gold rim to fit any interior aesthetic or party mood, these amazing drinking tumbler glasses will become a staple in any household for casual drinking of your favorite beverages! PRODUCT FEATURES Highball Tumblers with Gold Rims6 Pack10 OuncesPremium Glass MaterialClassy Design for Elegant PresentationAll-Purpose, Great for Whiskey, Bourbon, Cocktails, and ScotchDishwasher SafeElegant Gift Box PERFECT DRINKWARE FOR ANY SITUATION The best beverage experience starts with the glass you're drinking from. Our glasses are made of clean high-quality glass inside and out that won't tarnish the taste of your favorite drink. These tumblers are perfect for drinking soda, beer, juice, water, or any casual beverage in the comfort of your home. They're perfect for more elegant settings for wine tasting or drinking a nice cocktail at any party. They're stylishly designed to accommodate any setting with their simplistic construction that won't be too flashy or look too overwhelming among your other tableware. A stemless base makes for firm standing on a surface and reduces chances of spilling. EASY CARE DRINKING GLASSES Keep your glasses clean and ready for the next day by putting them in the dishwasher without worry! Dishwasher-safe construction makes cleaning them a breeze - or you can hand wash them with water and soap. These glasses will be a lovely addition to any home! Packaged in an elegant gift box, you can surprise anyone this holiday season with these fancy glasses to spruce up any kitchen! Let Kitchen Lux take your serveware to the next level - beautiful, elegant, and practical, our glassware will become a staple in your everyday life for casual or festive beverage enjoyment! Get your set today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k+MHtR0UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen Lux","source_asin":"B08MVFF8Q8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-716636","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MVFF8Q8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MVFF8Q8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
