window.products.push({"id":716688,"name":"Dayspring The Shepherd on The Search-Hanging Christmas Advent Calendar, Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aAzQhYy1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Count down to Christmas with the Shepherd on the Search Fabric Advent Calendar! Kids will have fun moving the shepherd to the next pocket each day until Christmas. Put daily surprises like candy, small toys, Scripture memory verses, and other fun treats into each of the 25 pockets. Best of all, on days 24 and 25 there are special message cards to tuck in each pocket, pointing your child back to Jesus, the true reason for the season. Designed to be enjoyed year after year, this high-quality advent calendar will become a family keepsake - start a new Christmas tradition with your children and grandchildren! Perfect to use along with the bestselling Shepherd on the Search Activity Set and other coordinating items. //////// Countdown to the real reason for Christmas with our new Shepherd on the Search™ Hanging Countdown. Kids will have fun moving the Shepherd from one pocket to the next until Christmas day. The pockets are great for putting daily surprises like a piece of candy, small toys and other items as well as special messages or Scripture memory verses for your child/children. Best of all, on day 24 and day 25 there are two special messages inserted into each pocket that point your child/children back to the true meaning of Christmas. Product Specifications: Dimensions: 22\" × 17\" Plush is 100% polyester Polyester/cotton canvas w. wood dowel rod Spot clean only 1 plush shepherd 2 special pocket messages on Day 24 & 25 Message: You will seek Me and find Me when you seek Me with all your heart.  Jeremiah 29:13 NIV Product Details Fun, interactive, advent countdown for kids and grandkids - start a new family Christmas tradition! Fun, interactive, advent countdown for kids and grandkids - start a new family Christmas tradition! Put daily surprises like candy, small toys, Scripture memory verses, and other fun treats in the 25 pockets; tuck the special message cards into the pockets for days 24 and 25 which point your child back to Jesus, the true reason for the season Put daily surprises like candy, small toys, Scripture memory verses, and other fun treats in the 25 pockets; tuck the special message cards into the pockets for days 24 and 25 which point your child back to Jesus, the true reason for the season Perfect to use along with the bestselling Shepherd on the Search Activity Set Perfect to use along with the bestselling Shepherd on the Search Activity Set Dimensions: 17\" x 22\" Dimensions: 17\" x 22\" Includes: 1 plush shepherd, 2 special pocket messages for Day 24 and 25 Includes: 1 plush shepherd, 2 special pocket messages for Day 24 and 25 Material: Material: Plush: 100% polyester Plush: 100% polyester Calendar: poly/cotton Calendar: poly/cotton Hanger: wooden dowel Hanger: wooden dowel Spot clean only Spot clean only Product by Dayspring Product by Dayspring","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aAzQhYy1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dayspring","source_asin":"B086RWNHFD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-716688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086RWNHFD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086RWNHFD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
