window.products.push({"id":716822,"name":"XIAFEI 2LB Takeout Foil Pans with Lids(50 Pack), Recyclable Food Storage,Disposable Aluminum Foil for Catering Party Meal Prep Freezer Drip Pans BBQ P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kPvC2q1WL._AC_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM ALUMINUM FOIL: Foil pans with cardboard lids, made with sturdy aluminum that will perform excellent in the kitchen. Durable and convenient foil pans. 50 aluminum pans with 50 cardboard lids perfect for baking, cooking, roasting, serving, fridge or freezer and transfer. Disposable take-out containers are essential supplies in almost any food service establishment. Dimensions of the pans/ Standard Size: 8.26’’x5.7’’x1.77’’ DURABLE & FUNCTIONAL: Well-made aluminum pans which means they’re not flimsy. Designed to facilitate air flow, make it ideal for even heat distribution which reduces the chance of burned baked goods and helps in creating a beautiful smooth crust. Excellent in the kitchen, picnic, camping, BBQ events and other indoor and outdoor activities. Browns beautifully! WIDE RIM: These foil pans have wide rims for easy carrying and a strong grip when placed over a chafer stand. Use these strong aluminum pans to serve food at your next party or event. They are sturdy enough to contain and transport large amounts of food to accommodate many guests. They’re perfect for birthday parties, anniversary dinners, Thanksgiving, Christmas, or any other holiday or get together that involves plenty of eating! CARDBOARD LIDS INCLUDED: Don’t worry about covering the pan with aluminum foil. The disposable food containers come with closeable hemmed edges that quickly seal the included flat cardboard lids tight. One side is plain white, and the other is foil-laminated for better heat retention. Take out food containers with lids to ensure your salads, and other foods stay fresh and uncontaminated during transport or delivery. SAVE MONEY WHILE SAVING THE ENVIRONMENT: These affordable, reusable, recyclable foil pans handle all your soups, stews, salads, cakes, cookies and other light to heavy fare, all while helping to reduce your carbon footprint. Clean kitchen. Clean conscience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kPvC2q1WL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XIAFEI","source_asin":"B09634JDTC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-716822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09634JDTC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09634JDTC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
